If you dont like desktop environment heres the window manager that available for syslack linux
WindowManagers In Syslack Linux List

-Fluxbox 
-Blackbox 
-WindowMaker 
-IceWM
-twm
-fvwm95

For fluxbox
sudo apt install fluxbox -y

For blackbox
sudo apt install blackbox -y

For WindowMaker
sudo apt install wmaker -y

For IceWM
sudo apt install icewm -y

For TWM
sudo apt install twm -y

For fvwm95

sudo apt install build-essential autoconf automake pkg-config xorg xinit xbitmaps libx11-dev libxt-dev libxext-dev libxpm-dev libreadline-dev libxmu-headers -y

git clone https://github.com/Mintsuki/fvwm95.git

cd fvwm95

./bootstrap
./configure --prefix=/usr/local
make
sudo make install

In order to start fvwm95 with xinit, add the following to your ~/.xinitrc file:

exec fvwm95
